The '''Golan M3185 space station'''<ref name="Battles" /> was a class of wheel-shaped [[space station]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] that was used for [[planet]]ary defense. The [[Shield Gate|Scarif Shield Gate]] was one such station, which provided planetary defense to the Imperial stronghold world of [[Scarif]]. The [[deflector shield]] had a global spread, with a magnitude and rigidity of fifty and an overlapping shell frequency pattern. The Golan M3185<ref name="Rebel Files">''[[Star Wars: The Rebel Files]]''</ref> shared a part of its name with other Imperial space station classes, including the [[Golan I Space Defense Platform]], the [[Golan-II Defense Platform]], and the [[Golan III defense platform]].<ref name="Starships" />

